      "widgets_values": [
        "# MOSS SFT Controlled\nNative ComfyUI MOSS support required. Use a Qwen3.5 9B encoder and Flux2 VAE. Layout dimensions come from Prompt Slot. Edit layout/maps in Studio Additional Inputs.\nSFT: 50 steps, CFG 3, shift 5. Destripe is optional: 0 off; author starting values 1 at 768 and 1.5 at 1024.\nControl adapter stays loaded even with maps disabled. For an unpatched baseline select MOSS SFT Create. Both maps share strength and interval.\nUser LoRAs belong in the separate model-family folder; required recipe adapters are in MOSS-Required."
